<title>USA: Lincoln National opens third China office.</title>
<headline>Lincoln National opens third China office.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WAYNE, Ind. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lincoln National Corp said Wednesday it will open its third office in China and hopes to find a joint venture partner there.</p>
<p>The office will be opened in Guangzhou on Thursday. The insurance and financial services company said it hopes to find a partner whose marketing skills can combine with its technical skills.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
